Provides: uos-ai, uos-ai-rag, uos-ai-agent
Description: Native aish-based UOS AI-compatible desktop assistant
 A Qt Quick frontend for the aish agent engine implementing the
 com.deepin.copilot and com.iflytek.aiassistant D-Bus contract used by DDE
 components. It provides screen-recorder quick OCR, Grand Search prompts,
 image upload, translation and the Super+Space shortcut.
 .
 It is a drop-in replacement for uos-ai, uos-ai-rag and uos-ai-agent.
